<title id="mt">Walking route map of the Dyker Heights Christmas lights, Brooklyn</title>
<desc id="md">Map of Dyker Heights between 10th and 13th Avenue and 82nd and 86th Street with the decorated blocks highlighted and a suggested walking loop.</desc>
